   "confidence": "low",
   "disproof": "Renewals signed at $9,500-$12,700, or fewer than 250 robots contracted by 2027-02",
   "impact": "-30% value; the base case becomes a bridge round at a flat or down price",
   "early_warning": "110 contracted plus 50 LOIs unchanged through Q1 2027; a grower renegotiating after a bruising complaint"
  },
  {
   "assumption": "The round closes at $18M by Q1 2027 with a Kestrel standstill, so the company reaches a Series B without breaching the $1.5M minimum-cash covenant",
   "confidence": "low",
   "disproof": "A close after Q1 2027, a $16M rather than $18M raise, or a burn above $410,000 a month",
   "impact": "-100% of the equity in a secured-lender event; if no minimum-cash test exists, a 25%-40% down round instead",
   "early_warning": "Covenant reached around 2027-03-14; only $4.0M of the round committed at 2026-10-31; no loan agreement or UCC-1 in the register"
